// An unresolved column may cross the discovery bound. A per-row baseline
// would be 10001 events long, so the summary stands in for it.
// The batches arrive on stdin: a `from_file` subpipeline would
// emit each unresolved batch separately.
load_stdin
read_feather
write_feather
read_feather
summarize rows=count(), non_null=count(x)
